---
flowchart TD
    request["Explicit Bitcoin request<br/>Extended public key, exact relative path<br/>Validated network and selected policy"]
    admit["Ordered request and key admission<br/>Depth-capacity check"]
    derive["Exact-path public derivation<br/>Complete derived public node"]
    hash["HASH160 of the derived compressed key<br/>Semantic origin retained"]
    binding{"Direct binding at encode<br/>Only the selected terminal runs"}
    pkh["P2PKH<br/>P2PKH payload construction<br/>Delegated Base58Check"]
    nested["P2SH-P2WPKH<br/>Redeem script, script HASH160<br/>P2SH payload, delegated Base58Check"]
    native["P2WPKH<br/>Key hash binds directly as program<br/>Delegated SegWit-v0 encoder + HRP"]
    result["Complete address result<br/>Same admitted network, policy and path"]
    stop["Failure invariant at every executed stage<br/>Throw aborts the operation<br/>No later stage, fallback or partial result"]
    request --> admit --> derive --> hash --> binding
    binding -->|p2pkh| pkh
    binding -->|p2sh-p2wpkh| nested
    binding -->|p2wpkh| native
    pkh --> result
    nested --> result
    native --> result
    result ~~~ stop
    classDef agreed fill:#eaf2ff,stroke:#2456a6,color:#14233b
    classDef outcome fill:#eaf7ed,stroke:#28783b,color:#173b20
    classDef error fill:#fff0ee,stroke:#b33d32,color:#57231e
    class request,admit,derive,hash,binding,pkh,nested,native agreed
    class result outcome
